  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide agricultural livelihood assistance to internally displaced persons affected by flooding in Kaya, Koulikime, and Mamdi. This FAO project distributes seeds, agricultural tools and livestock. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 15,000 people, including 8,000 women, 3,500 men, 3,500 children, and including 530 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
